{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063260/block/singleImage/3264463/df/01M7506S4XRT78NC8NCHEEH822.jpg?updatedAt=1794390701\"/><figcaption>富士高實業發盈警，主要受匯兌因素及存貨撥備預期提高拖累（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>富士高實業 (927) 公佈，預計截至 2026 年 9 月 30 日，歸屬股權持有人之虧損將介乎約 1,000 萬港元至約 1,500 萬港元之間。去年同期則為 320 萬元，按年升 2.13 倍至 3.69 倍。 報告內提及，虧損增加主要是由於期內人民幣兌港元升值，導致以港元計價之整體生產成本上升，及儘管預期收入主要因一名新客戶而增加，惟 2026 年中期期間內現有客戶預測下調令存貨撥備預期有所提高。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:56:46.213139+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":238,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:51:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T17:15:10.429147+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:50:07.830387+00:00","content_hash":"8f6f7e0591a388f777f05a24f689fae986f32d086a3f033eee9213b556cbfacd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:56:46.213139+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}